<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="mu">RK Classes — school / coaching management app (Android &amp; web) &middot; Last updated: 14 October 2026</div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px;">
    <p>RK Classes ("we", "the institute") uses this app and website to run the institute: student records, attendance,
    test marks, fees, teacher attendance and payments, and communication with parents. This policy explains what
    information is stored, why, and your choices. The app is meant for the institute's staff, class representatives and
    the parents / guardians of its students.</p>

    <h2>1. Information we store</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Staff and class-representative accounts:</b> name, username, password, phone number, e-mail, role and the rights given by the admin.</li>
      <li><b>Parent accounts:</b> phone number, name and password chosen at sign-up.</li>
      <li><b>Student records:</b> name, admission number, class / medium / batch, date of birth, gender, address, student and parent phone numbers, parent names, photograph (if added).</li>
      <li><b>Academic and fee records:</b> daily attendance, test marks, fee structure, payments and receipts, discounts and balances.</li>
      <li><b>Staff work records:</b> teacher attendance (subject, topic, in/out time), lectures and teacher payments.</li>
      <li><b>Technical data:</b> login time and the device token needed to keep you signed in. We do not collect your location, contacts, photos, microphone or camera data.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Why we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To run attendance, marks, fees, reports and staff payments of the institute.</li>
      <li>To let parents see their own child's attendance, marks, fees, lectures and results.</li>
      <li>To contact parents (for example absence alerts) using the phone numbers the institute holds.</li>
      <li>To keep the system secure (sign-in, access rights, audit of who added or changed a record).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Who can see it</h2>
    <p>Only the institute's own staff, according to the rights the admin gives them, and each parent for their own child.
    A class representative can see and enter data only for his own class. <b>We do not sell your data and we do not show
    advertisements.</b> We do not share personal data with third parties, except where the law requires it.</p>
    <p>When a staff member taps "WhatsApp" or "Call" the app only opens the phone's own WhatsApp / dialer with the number and
    message; the message is sent by that person's own WhatsApp account, not by our server.</p>

    <h2>4. Storage and security</h2>
    <p>Data is stored on the institute's server and sent between the app and the server over an encrypted (HTTPS)
    connection. Access needs a username and password, and access rights can be changed or switched off by the admin at any time.</p>

    <h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>Records are kept while the student studies at the institute and afterwards for as long as needed for fee, academic
    and legal record keeping. Deleted records are first moved to a "Deleted Records" area and can be removed permanently on request.</p>

    <h2>6. Your choices, correction and deletion</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You can ask us to correct wrong information or to delete your account and the data linked to it.</li>
      <li>How to request deletion is described at <a href="/Home/DeleteAccount">/Home/DeleteAccount</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Children</h2>
    <p>The app is not offered to children directly. Student data is entered by the institute and viewed by parents / guardians.
    Class representatives are senior students who work under the institute's staff.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy we will update the date above. Continued use of the app means you accept the updated policy.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>RK Classes<br/>E-mail: <a href="mailto:rkclasseskapilsir2002@gmail.com">rkclasseskapilsir2002@gmail.com</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
